cff-version: 1.2.0

message: "If you use HADIA-KB or the HADIA software in research, please cite this release."

title: "HADIA-KB: An Evidence-Linked Knowledge Base and Interactive Research Platform for Handia/Hadia/Haria"

version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-27
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Akhtar"
    given-names: "Mohammad Amir Khusru"

doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22132285

url: "https://github.com/Arithmetic-Power-Geometry/HADIA-KB"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Arithmetic-Power-Geometry/HADIA-KB"

abstract: "HADIA-KB is an open, evidence-linked digital knowledge base and interactive research platform for publicly documented knowledge concerning Handia/Hadia/Haria, a traditional rice-based fermented beverage (rice beer), with Jharkhand, India, as its primary geographic focus. It integrates source-linked evidence concerning Ranu and other starter cultures, plant ingredients, fermentation, microorganisms, chemical and nutritional measurements, communities, geography, cultural practices, policy, law, and scientific literature while preserving provenance, terminology, geographic context, and evidence type."

